
 >> x := Into okusha.
 >> y := Into okusha.
 >> z := x.
 Okuphumayo bhala: ( x kuyefana: y ), umugqa-omusha.
 Okuphumayo bhala: ( x kuyefana: z ), umugqa-omusha.
 Okuphumayo bhala: ( x = y ), umugqa-omusha.
 Okuphumayo bhala: ( x = z ), umugqa-omusha.
 Okuphumayo bhala: ( x ≠ y ), umugqa-omusha.
 Okuphumayo bhala: ( x ≠ z ), umugqa-omusha.
 